e\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"16\"></line>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"btn__inner mute-btn__inner absolute\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner-bg mute-btn__fill absolute fill js-mute-fill\"></span>\n</div>\n</button>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom left pointer-events-none js-mobile-video-progress\" style=\"width: 2.7rem; height: 2.7rem; bottom: -0.8rem; left: 5rem;\">\n<span class=\"video-indicator video-indicator--video absolute fill\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<circle class=\"video-indicator__outer js-cursor-video-outer\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"49\"></circle>\n<g class=\"\">\n<path class=\"js-video-play\" d=\"M58,49.1c0.7,0.4,0.7,1.3,0,1.7l-14.2,8.2c-0.7,0.4-1.5-0.1-1.5-0.9V41.8c0-0.8,0.8-1.3,1.5-0.9L58,49.1z\" fill=\"#040404\"></path>\n<g class=\"js-video-pause\">\n<path d=\"M47.1,38.5h-4.2c-0.7,0-1.2,0.6-1.2,1.2v17.5c0,0.7,0.6,1.2,1.2,1.2h4.2c0.7,0,1.2-0.6,1.2-1.2V39.7\nC48.3,39.1,47.8,38.5,47.1,38.5z\"></path>\n<path d=\"M57.1,38.5h-4.2c-0.7,0-1.2,0.6-1.2,1.2v17.5c0,0.7,0.6,1.2,1.2,1.2h4.2c0.7,0,1.2-0.6,1.2-1.2V39.7\nC58.3,39.1,57.8,38.5,57.1,38.5z\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nModular\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nThe first theme we focused on visualising was the idea of modularity. As the robots can be configured in numerous ways, we aimed to convey the idea of individual modules coming together in a smooth motion before connecting to reveal the final form of the RobCo robot.<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_S1-1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2969\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm js-slider-wrap\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"slider container px-2 px-8@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--16/9\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child visible js-slider\" dom2webgl=\"c:Slider\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_003-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_009-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_009-3-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_021-2-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_004-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-between mt-1.5 t-1.1\">\n<div><span class=\"js-slider-index\">1</span>/5</div>\n<div>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase js-slider-prev\" data-cursor=\"hide\" disabled=\"\">Prev<span></span></button>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase ml-0.25 js-slider-next\" data-cursor=\"hide\">Next<span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nEasy\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nThe second chapter of the animation highlighted the ease of using the robots. Through the native RobCo software and app, users can quickly and effortlessly configure the robots to  <br/>\ncarry out various tasks. To showcase this, we designed a stylised interface that depicted the simple drag and drop nature of the software in a more visually engaging form. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Robco-S2.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2970\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm js-slider-wrap\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"slider container px-2 px-8@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--16/9\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child visible js-slider\" dom2webgl=\"c:Slider\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_003-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_004-1-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_005-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_006-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_040-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-between mt-1.5 t-1.1\">\n<div><span class=\"js-slider-index\">1</span>/5</div>\n<div>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase js-slider-prev\" data-cursor=\"hide\" disabled=\"\">Prev<span></span></button>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase ml-0.25 js-slider-next\" data-cursor=\"hide\">Next<span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nAdaptable\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nAdaptability was another core theme we needed to convey in the video – the robots’ ability to be configured for various environments and equipped with different attachments to suit specific use cases. To illustrate this, we depicted the robot in three common scenarios with sleek cuts between each scene to enhance the visual flow. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Adaptable.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2978\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm js-slider-wrap\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"slider container px-2 px-8@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--16/9\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child visible js-slider\" dom2webgl=\"c:Slider\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_003-2-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-3-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_004-1-2-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-2-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_005-1-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-between mt-1.5 t-1.1\">\n<div><span class=\"js-slider-index\">1</span>/5</div>\n<div>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase js-slider-prev\" data-cursor=\"hide\" disabled=\"\">Prev<span></span></button>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase ml-0.25 js-slider-next\" data-cursor=\"hide\">Next<span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nAutonomous\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nThe final chapter focused on autonomy and the advanced smart technology within the robots, which utilises AI to organise and manage fleets efficiently. To convey this concept, we designed a scan-reveal effect that alludes to the robot’s complex inner workings and showcased smart features such as part scanning and detection. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Robco-S3.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2987\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm js-slider-wrap\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"slider container px-2 px-8@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--16/9\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child visible js-slider\" dom2webgl=\"c:Slider\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Frame-4-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_003-3-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_004-1-3-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_005-1-2-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_006-1-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_006-2-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_006-3-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_006-4-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_020-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"js-slider-image\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RobCo_Styleframe_021-1-1600x900.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-between mt-1.5 t-1.1\">\n<div><span class=\"js-slider-index\">1</span>/10</div>\n<div>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase js-slider-prev\" data-cursor=\"hide\" disabled=\"\">Prev<span></span></button>\n<button class=\"t-uppercase ml-0.25 js-slider-next\" data-cursor=\"hide\">Next<span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"testimonial w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 my-10@md\">\n<h2 class=\"t-1.3 t-2@sm t-uppercase mb-0 t-500\">From the client</h2>\n<div class=\"testimonial__text-box mt-1 pt-1 mb-1.5\">\n<p class=\"w-1/1 t-2 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-500 mb-0\">\n“The animation produced by Nocturne seamlessly brought our USPs, key messaging, and core values to life through a show-stopping motion piece that serves as a cornerstone in how we communicate our story. Through the partnership, Nocturne demonstrated a strong understanding of our brand, and goals and brought a level of creativity that truly elevated the final product.”\n</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"t-uppercase t-base t-1.3@sm t-500\">\nRoman Hölzl, Founder &amp; CEO at RobCo\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
